WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.377
On this slide, we are focusing on why sequences matter in analytics.

00:00:04.377 --> 00:00:09.637
Start with the meaning of the idea before worrying about the exact syntax.

00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:15.777
Ask what information is going in, what Python is doing with it, and what result should come out.

00:00:15.777 --> 00:00:19.657
Think of the sequence as a small collection of observations.

00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:26.357
Ask whether order matters, whether values need to change, and whether you need one item, a range,

00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:28.742
or a summary of the entire collection.

00:00:28.742 --> 00:00:34.497
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:34.497 --> 00:00:39.916
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
